   "module_16049493631818": {
    "body": {
     "hs_enable_module_padding": true,
     "hs_wrapper_css": {
      "padding-bottom": "20px",
      "padding-left": "20px",
      "padding-right": "20px",
      "padding-top": "25px"
     },
     "html": "<p style=\"font-size: 15px; line-height: 150%; text-align: left;\"><span style=\"color: #ffffff; font-family: Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-weight: normal; color: #000000;\"><span style=\"color: #425b76;\">Hi</span> {{ contact.firstname }},</span></span><span style=\"color: #000000;\">&nbsp;</span></p>\n<p style=\"font-size: 15px; line-height: 150%; text-align: left;\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p>If you want to provide your patients with increased absorption or an easier way to take their vitamins, liposomal technology can significantly benefit your practice and your clients.<br><br>We want to ensure that we're helping you and your patients get the most out of their supplements by providing them with quality ingredients that are thoroughly tested. Private labeling products like our Liposomal C supplement can help you accomplish that!<br><br>That said, not all liquid vitamins are created equally. Liposomal liquid technology is at the vanguard of nutrient delivery systems.</p>\n<ul>\n<li>Accelerated intestinal absorption</li>\n<li>Better protection and stability than other encapsulation technologies</li>\n<li>Better active ingredient bioavailability</li>\n<li>Ability to incorporate fat and water-soluble compounds into liposomes</li>\n<li>Controlled, uniform release of active ingredients</li>\n<li>Protects gut lining from irritation.</li>\n<li>Low toxicity and low allergenicity</li>\n</ul>\n<p>Click below to download our guide and learn more about liposomal technology and its plethora of benefits.<br><br></p>\n<p style=\"text-align: left; font-size: 22px; line-height: 131%;\"><a href=\"https://f.hubspotusercontent30.net/hubfs/4087538/Liposomal%20Technology.pdf\" rel=\"noopener\"><span style=\"font-weight: bold;\">Download our Liposomal Technology Guide Here</span></a></p>\n<p>*<em>This is a direct file download, you won't have to enter any additional information.*</em></p>",
     "module_id": 1155639
    },
    "child_css": {},
    "css": {},
